   "sourceHash": "26b652cbe656a7b5fa6e67628ef732d0f1f9fc758a93c22d9df24a87ccbd7e99",
   "text": "ヨガが初めての方にとって、Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Villageは始めるのに最適な場所です。当院の",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
